  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, mix together lamb, garam masala, olive oil, lemon juice, and garlic.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Spread the lamb mixture on a baking sheet and bake for 20 minutes.",
    "Meanwhile, toast the bread until crispy.",
    "Assemble the dish by placing a slice of toasted bread at the bottom of a mason jar.",
    "Add a layer of lamb on top of the bread.",
    "Sprinkle feta cheese and parsley over the lamb.",
    "Repeat the layers one more time, ending with a layer of toasted bread on top."
